  /**
   * Read the bytes of an embedded-file stream.
   * @param {BaseStream} stream
   *   Embedded-file stream.
   * @returns {CatalogAttachmentContent}
   *   Attachment bytes.
   * @throws {PasswordException}
   *   When the bytes are encrypted and no key is available.
